  "body_html": "<p><img alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://scontent-b-lga.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-prn2/t1/1451480_10151751041782647_1115544237_n.jpg\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.6875;\" width=\"960\"/></p>\n<!--[if lt IE 9]><![endif]-->\n<audio class=\"wp-audio-shortcode\" controls=\"controls\" id=\"audio-4350-1\" preload=\"none\" style=\"width: 100%;\"><source src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/The-Library-is-On-Fire-labyrinths-of-february.mp3?_=1\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"/><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/The-Library-is-On-Fire-labyrinths-of-february.mp3\">http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/The-Library-is-On-Fire-labyrinths-of-february.mp3</a></audio>\n<p>The brand new song of Brooklyn-based indie rockers The Library Is On Fire just leaked through Flowers In A Gun! “Labyrinths of February” is a standout track from The Library is On Fire’s new album “Halcyon &amp; Surrounding Areas”, which will be released on April 15th. “Inspired by the loneliness of life in the city, the song conjures a poetic metaphor of the search for connection through the austere, relentless cold and snow of a winter in New York.” says frontman Steve Five.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><a href=\"http://snk.to/f-cdpl7y4s\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">DOWNLOAD IT FOR FREE HERE!</span></a></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/391829_10150418687732647_1473247562_n.jpg\"><img alt=\"391829_10150418687732647_1473247562_n\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-4352\" height=\"672\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/391829_10150418687732647_1473247562_n.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>",
